context:
PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}/zones/{zone_id}
Add a zone as a member of a particular address map.
Required: zone_id (path); address_map_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}/accounts/{member_account_id}
Add an account as a member of a particular address map.
Required: account_id (path); address_map_id (path); member_account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}/ips/{ip_address}
Add an IP from a prefix owned by the account to a particular address map.
Required: ip_address (path); address_map_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}
Show a particular address map owned by the account.
Required: address_map_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}
Delete a particular address map owned by the account. An Address Map must be disabled before it can be deleted.
Required: address_map_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}/zones/{zone_id}
Remove a zone as a member of a particular address map.
Required: zone_id (path); address_map_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}/accounts/{member_account_id}
Remove an account as a member of a particular address map.
Required: account_id (path); address_map_id (path); member_account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}/ips/{ip_address}
Remove an IP from a particular address map.
Required: ip_address (path); address_map_id (path); account_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/address_maps/{address_map_id}
Modify properties of an address map owned by the account.
Required: address_map_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}/delegations/{delegation_id}
Delete an account delegation for a given IP prefix.
Required: delegation_id (path); prefix_id (path); account_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}/bgp/prefixes/{bgp_prefix_id}
Delete a BGP Prefix associated with the specified IP Prefix. A BGP Prefix must be withdrawn before it can be deleted.
Required: account_id (path); prefix_id (path); bgp_prefix_id (path)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}
Delete an unapproved prefix owned by the account.
Required: prefix_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}/bgp/prefixes/{bgp_prefix_id}
Retrieve a single BGP Prefix according to its identifier
Required: account_id (path); prefix_id (path); bgp_prefix_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}
List a particular prefix owned by the account.
Required: prefix_id (path); account_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}/bgp/prefixes/{bgp_prefix_id}
Update the properties of a BGP Prefix, such as the on demand advertisement status (advertised or withdrawn).
Required: account_id (path); prefix_id (path); bgp_prefix_id (path); body (body)

PATCH /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}
Modify the description for a prefix owned by the account.
Required: prefix_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}/bindings/{binding_id}
Delete a Service Binding
Required: account_id (path); prefix_id (path); binding_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/addressing/prefixes/{prefix_id}/bindings/{binding_id}
Fetch a single Service Binding
Required: account_id (path); prefix_id (path); binding_id (path)
